{"id":"msg_m_ex_leona_02","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_leona","label":"Leona · Nikke"},"label":"2. Zoo Keeper,","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_ex_leona_01","next":"msg_m_ex_leona_03","speakers":{"leona":"Leona"},"icons":{"leona":"si_c382_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_ex_leona_02_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_02_1","text":"Zoo Keeper,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_02_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_02_2","text":"we just got a new arrival.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_02_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_02_3","text":"Wanna guess what kind of animal it is?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_02_4","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_02_4","text":"Can I have some clues?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_02_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_02_5","text":"It's got a round face and ears,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_02_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_02_6","text":"and it's super cute.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_02_7","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_02_7","text":"A dog?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_02_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_02_8","text":"Wrong.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_02_9","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_02_9","text":"Hmm... give me some more hints.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_02_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_02_10","text":"Okay.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_02_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_02_11","text":"Normally, it walks on four legs,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_02_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_02_12","text":"but it can walk on two if it wants to.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_02_13","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_02_13","text":"A meerkat?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_02_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_02_14","text":"!!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_02_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_02_15","text":"You know about meerkats?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_02_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_02_16","text":"I'm impressed with how much you know about animals,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_02_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_02_17","text":"but I'm afraid that's incorrect.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_02_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_02_18","text":"It's bigger than a meerkat.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_02_19","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_02_19","text":"Is it... a bear?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_02_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_02_20","text":"That's it!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_02_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_02_21","text":"It's a Kodiak bear, which is one of the biggest bears around.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_02_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_02_22","text":"I brought him here after I found him injured up on the surface.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_02_23","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_02_23","text":"I thought you said it was cute.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_02_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_02_24","text":"Bears are cute!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_02_25","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_02_25","text":"They can tear humans limb from limb.","jump":"m_ex_leona_02_27"},{"id":"m_ex_leona_02_26","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_02_26","text":"I've never seen one in person, so I guess I'm not sure.","jump":"m_ex_leona_02_29"},{"id":"m_ex_leona_02_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_02_27","text":"Sure, but I've treated and moved him to a safe place.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_02_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_02_28","text":"It'll be fine.","jump":"m_ex_leona_02_30"},{"id":"m_ex_leona_02_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_02_29","text":"You haven't?","jump":"m_ex_leona_02_30"},{"id":"m_ex_leona_02_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_02_30","text":"Would you like to take a look?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_02_31","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_02_31","text":"Can I?","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_02_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_02_32","text":"Of course.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_02_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_02_33","text":"His treatment is nearly finished,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_02_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_02_34","text":"so just let me know when you've got some spare time.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_02_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"leona","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_02_35","text":"Who knows, maybe it'll be love at first sight with you two, hehe.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_leona_02_36","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_leona_02_36","text":"Looking forward to seeing him.","jump":null}],"chat":true}